188
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:41,760
Right.

189
00:08:41,760 --> 00:08:42,760
All right.

190
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:43,760
The point, the important part is that you were measured.

191
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:45,240
You got measured, but we could have a different phrase.

192
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:55,770
We say, for example, I will measure this table or he measures the height of the door and we know he measures.

193
00:08:56,390 --> 00:08:57,330
I will measure.

194
00:08:57,550 --> 00:08:58,930
We know who the actor is.

195
00:08:59,010 --> 00:09:03,930
That means it's active voice because the focus is on who's doing this action.

196
00:09:04,660 --> 00:09:08,720
And in passive voice, the important thing is who is receiving the action.

197
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:09,720
